---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "DPlanner Photography Journal | Wedding & Studio Guides in Ibadan"
description: "Expert wedding photography pricing guides, planning advice, traditional engagement tips, and studio ideas in Ibadan and Oyo State by Samuel Damilare."
ogImage: /assets/og/home.png
permalink: /blog/
extraCss: /assets/css/blog.css
---

<header class="blog-index-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="label-over">Knowledge &amp; Editorial Guides</span>
    <h1 class="blog-index-title">The DPlanner Journal</h1>
    <p class="blog-index-lead">
      Practical pricing breakdowns, cultural wedding guides, location recommendations, and candid planning advice from lead photographer Samuel Damilare.
    </p>
  </div>
</header>

<section class="blog-posts-section" aria-label="Published Articles">
  <div class="container">
    
    <div class="blog-grid">
      {%- for post in collections.posts %}
      <article>
        <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="blog-card">
          <div class="blog-card-media">
            <img src="{{ post.data.heroImage or post.data.ogImage or "/assets/img/flyer.png" }}" alt="{{ post.data.title }}" width="600" height="375" loading="lazy" decoding="async">
            <span class="blog-card-badge">{{ post.data.category or "Editorial Guide" }}</span>
          </div>
          <div class="blog-card-content">
            <div class="blog-card-meta">
              <time datetime="{{ post.data.date | dateIso }}">{{ post.data.date | dateReadable }}</time>
              <span>&bull;</span>
              <span>{{ post.templateContent | readingTime }}</span>
            </div>
            <h2 class="blog-card-title">{{ post.data.title }}</h2>
            <p class="blog-card-excerpt">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
            <div class="blog-card-footer">
              <span>Read Full Article &rarr;</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </a>
      </article>
      {%- endfor %}
    </div>

    <!-- Direct Booking Banner -->
    <div class="cta-banner" style="margin-top: 40px;">
      <h2>Have a Question About Your Upcoming Event?</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you are planning a traditional engagement in Oyo State, need full wedding coverage, or want a studio session in Yemetu, message our booking desk directly.
      </p>
      <div class="cta-banner-buttons">
        <a href="{{ "Hello DPlanner Photography! I was reading your journal and would like to ask a question." | wa }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-hero-book btn-lg">
          <i class="fa-brands fa-whatsapp" aria-hidden="true"></i> Message on WhatsApp
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<!-- Breadcrumb JSON-LD -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{{ [
  { name: "Home", url: "/" },
  { name: "Journal", url: "/blog/" }
] | breadcrumbSchema(site) | jsonld | safe }}
</script>
